            "id": "msg_85a3205730",
            "role": "user",
            "content": "# DeepSeek Agent - Phase 5: Harden Authentication and Session Security\n\nThe authentication architecture is largely complete.\n\nPerform a complete security hardening pass.\n\nDo not redesign the application.\n\nImprove security while preserving current functionality.\n\n---\n\n## Authentication\n\nAudit login.php.\n\nRemove:\n\n* duplicate password_verify() calls\n* duplicate pending checks\n* duplicate rejected checks\n* dead code\n* unreachable code\n\nCreate one linear validation pipeline.\n\n---\n\n## Sessions\n\nVerify:\n\nsession_regenerate_id(true)\n\nis executed immediately after successful login.\n\nDestroy sessions completely on logout.\n\nDelete expired sessions automatically.\n\n---\n\n## Cookies\n\nUse only secure cookies.\n\nVerify:\n\nHttpOnly\n\nSecure\n\nSameSite=Lax (or Strict)\n\nEnable cookie-only authentication if frontend and backend share the same domain.\n\n---\n\n## Remove URL Authentication\n\nDelete every use of:\n\n$_GET['token']\n\nAuthentication must never be accepted from URL parameters.\n\nAccept only:\n\nAuthorization Header\n\nor\n\nSecure HttpOnly Cookie\n\n---\n\n## Refresh Token\n\nAudit refresh_token.\n\nIf unused:\n\nremove it.\n\nIf required:\n\nimplement rotation.\n\nDo not leave dead security code.\n\n---\n\n## CSRF\n\nVerify every state-changing endpoint:\n\nPOST\n\nPUT\n\nPATCH\n\nDELETE\n\nrequires CSRF validation.\n\n---\n\n## Authorization\n\nEvery API endpoint must verify:\n\nAuthentication\n\n\u2193\n\nRole\n\n\u2193\n\nPermission\n\n\u2193\n\nBusiness Logic\n\nNever trust frontend role values.\n\n---\n\n## Security Headers\n\nVerify:\n\nX-Frame-Options\n\nX-Content-Type-Options\n\nReferrer-Policy\n\nPermissions-Policy\n\nContent-Security-Policy\n\n---\n\n## Rate Limiting\n\nVerify login endpoint has stronger limits.\n\nRecommended:\n\n5 failed logins\n\n\u2193\n\nTemporary lock\n\n\u2193\n\nAudit Log\n\n---\n\n## Audit\n\nLog:\n\nLogin\n\nLogout\n\nFailed Login\n\nPassword Change\n\nRole Change\n\nPermission Change\n\nAccount Approval\n\nAccount Rejection\n\nSession Expiry\n\n---\n\n## Final Report\n\nProvide:\n\n1. Vulnerabilities fixed.\n2. Security improvements.\n3. Remaining risks.\n4. OWASP compliance assessment.\n5. Production readiness score.",
